    "excerpt_id": "Waktu itu aku lagi meeting  bareng klien pertamaku, pemilik bisnis tour dan travel di Bali. Proyek pertama nih bos semangat masih membara. Sampai di bagian pembahasan teknis, aku m...",
    "excerpt_en": "At the beginning of freelancing, I often thought clients cared about how clean the code was or which modern frameworks I used. It turns out they just want to know if it works, when it's done, and why...",
