    "excerpt_id": "Jujur, aku sempat skeptis. Paid ads kayak Meta ads itu kesannya mahal, ribet, dan lebih cocok buat brand besar. Tapi aku liat banyak banget freelancer yang udah nyobain dan mereka...",
    "excerpt_en": "I used to be skeptical about paid ads. I thought Meta Ads were only for big e-commerce brands with huge budgets. But after trying it myself, it completely changed how I acquire web development clients...",
